flowchart TD
    Agent[Agent observes and writes PTC] --> API[Frame-bound node API]
    API --> Inspect[Read node or artifact]
    API --> Run[Run node]
    Run --> Code[Code runner]
    Run --> Fresh[Fresh agent runner]
    Code --> API
    Fresh --> API
    API --> Stage[Stage candidate]
    Stage --> Review{Required reviews}
    Review -->|invoke reviewer nodes| Run
    Review -->|pass| Accepted[Accepted artifact]
    Review -->|unresolved| Unresolved[Needs review]
